co/storage/disk60/seasons/25761810-302a-47fa-96cd-6ae60e759150.jpg","likes":15,"dislikes":3,"views":2293,"release_date":"1270339200000","season_number":1,"description":"7.08 Ranked #3425Popularity #7846Members 1,795Spring 2010TVFuture Planet, Beijing Huihuang Animation Company\r\nAdd to ListEpisodes: \r\n0\r\n/52* Your list is public by default.\r\nEditSynopsis\r\nChinese-Japanese anime adaptation of the \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms\" classic novel.\r\n\r\nLui Bei embarks on a journey to quell the chaos that plagues his homeland, bringing with him his sworn brothers, Zhang Fei and Guan Yu. With only a small army and no land Lui Bei is forced to take a subservient role to other Generals, in order to keep him safe from those who continually come after his life.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.1}],"value":7.1,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":5583,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}